---@field enableWidget? boolean Optional. Deprecated: The Google Maps contextual widget behavior in Grounding with Google Maps is being deprecated; this field is planned for removal and no longer has any effect once removed. If true, include the widget context token in the response.
---@field groundingTypes? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoogleMapsGroundingTypes Optional. Specifies the types of Google Maps grounding to enable. Defaults to `places` when unset, and to `places` and `routing` for Gemini 4 and later models. When set, only the listed types are enabled; for example, setting only `places` disables routing.

---Defines the types of Google Maps grounding that can be enabled and their configurations.
