---@field routing? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoogleMapsRouting Optional. Enables grounding with Google Maps Routing APIs (ComputeRoutes and SearchAlongRoute). Also enabled by default for Gemini 4 and later models when no `GroundingTypes` are specified.

---Grounding with Google Maps Places data (e.g. QueryPlaces). This is the default Google Maps grounding type when no other type is specified.
