---@field uri? string The URI of the place.
---@field route? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsRoute Output only. Route information.
---@field placeAnswerSources? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSources The sources that were used to generate the place answer. This includes review snippets and photos that were used to generate the answer, as well as URIs to flag content.
---@field placeId? string This Place's resource name, in `places/{place_id}` format. This can be used to look up the place in the Google Maps API.
---@field text? string The text of the place answer.
---@field title? string The title of the place.

---The sources that were used to generate the place answer. This includes review snippets and photos that were used to generate the answer, as well as URIs to flag content.
---@class gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSources
---@field reviewSnippets? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GroundingChunkMapsPlaceAnswerSourcesReviewSnippetList Snippets of reviews that were used to generate the answer.

---A review snippet that is used to generate the answer.
