---@field nullValue? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1PartialArgNullValueEnum|string Optional. Represents a null value.
---@field willContinue? boolean Optional. Whether this is not the last part of the same json_path. If true, another PartialArg message for the current json_path is expected to follow.
