---Tool details that the model may use to generate response. A `Tool` is a piece of code that enables the system to interact with external systems to perform an action, or set of actions, outside of knowledge and scope of the model. A Tool object should contain exactly one type of Tool (e.g FunctionDeclaration, Retrieval or GoogleSearchRetrieval).
---@class gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Tool
---@field retrieval? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Retrieval Optional. Retrieval tool type. System will always execute the provided retrieval tool(s) to get external knowledge to answer the prompt. Retrieval results are presented to the model for generation.
---@field functionDeclarations? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1FunctionDeclarationList Optional. Function tool type. One or more function declarations to be passed to the model along with the current user query. Model may decide to call a subset of these functions by populating FunctionCall in the response. User should provide a FunctionResponse for each function call in the next turn. Based on the function responses, Model will generate the final response back to the user. Maximum 512 function declarations can be provided.
---@field codeExecution? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolCodeExecution Optional. CodeExecution tool type. Enables the model to execute code as part of generation.
---@field enterpriseWebSearch? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1EnterpriseWebSearch Optional. Tool to support searching public web data, powered by Vertex AI Search and Sec4 compliance.
---@field googleSearch? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolGoogleSearch Optional. GoogleSearch tool type. Tool to support Google Search in Model. Powered by Google.
---@field googleMaps? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoogleMaps Optional. GoogleMaps tool type. Tool to support Google Maps in Model.
---@field urlContext? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1UrlContext Optional. Tool to support URL context retrieval.
---@field exaAiSearch? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolExaAiSearch Optional. Uses Exa.ai to search for information to answer user queries. The search results will be grounded on Exa.ai and presented to the model for response generation
---@field parallelAiSearch? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolParallelAiSearch Optional. If specified, Vertex AI will use Parallel.ai to search for information to answer user queries. The search results will be grounded on Parallel.ai and presented to the model for response generation
---@field googleSearchRetrieval? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GoogleSearchRetrieval Optional. Specialized retrieval tool that is powered by Google Search.
---@field computerUse? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ToolComputerUse Optional. Tool to support the model interacting directly with the computer. If enabled, it automatically populates computer-use specific Function Declarations.

---Tool that executes code generated by the model, and automatically returns the result to the model. See also ExecutableCode and CodeExecutionResult, which are input and output to this tool.
