---@field cachedContent? string Optional. The name of the cached content used as context to serve the prediction. Note: only used in explicit caching, where users can have control over caching (e.g. what content to cache) and enjoy guaranteed cost savings. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/cachedContents/{cachedContent}`
