---@field outputConfig? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1GenerateContentRequestOutputConfig Optional. Configuration for persisting output assets to external storage.
---@field contents? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1ContentList Required. The content of the current conversation with the model. For single-turn queries, this is a single instance. For multi-turn queries, this is a repeated field that contains conversation history + latest request.
---@field systemInstruction? gcp.unstable.firebaseml_v2beta.GoogleCloudAiplatformV1beta1Content Optional. The user provided system instructions for the model. Note: only text should be used in parts and content in each part will be in a separate paragraph.
